  "description": "Post to social networks from a server: one channel contract (compose within each network's limits, pictures as native media with alt text or else a link card, tags, an idempotency key) and adapters for Bluesky (AT Protocol, app password, facets, images or an external card), Mastodon (instance token, Idempotency-Key, media), Discord (incoming webhook or bot channel, attachments or an embed) and X (API v2 in user context, OAuth 1.0a or OAuth 2, media). A post either lands with the network's URL and id or fails with a reason category; expected failures never throw. A retry after a lost answer re-reads before re-sending where the network allows. Credentials come from the host; the package stores nothing.",
  "id": "AgentKit.Social",
